flowchart TD
  need["Start here: a confined Claude Code<br/>cannot reach its Keychain sign-in"]:::start
  read["Ravel reads the sign-in<br/>and passes on the access token"]
  grant["The profile admits<br/>the Keychain services and files"]
  wrapper["A wrapper reads a token file<br/>through a runtime read"]
  plain["A plaintext sign-in file<br/>inside the grants"]
  handoff["Token handoff<br/>through a socket"]
  readx["Rejected: the terms forbid it,<br/>and a run ends with the access token"]
  grantx["Rejected: the agent could ask<br/>for any Keychain item"]
  wrapperx["Rejected: the agent can read<br/>the one-year token"]
  plainx["Rejected: a confined refresh<br/>rotates the owner's sign-in"]
  agreed["Agreed by the owner<br/>on 2026-11-03"]
  need --> read --> readx
  need --> grant --> grantx
  need --> wrapper --> wrapperx
  need --> plain --> plainx
  need --> handoff --> agreed
  classDef start fill:#173451,color:#fff,stroke:#102a43,font-weight:bold
